-```
-<Domain>TestSupport/
-  Mocks/
-    <Domain>+ServiceMock.swift
-    <Domain>+RouterMock.swift      (if needed)
-  Stubs/
-    <Domain>+Model+Stubs.swift
-  Assertions/
-    <Domain>+Action+Testable.swift
-    <Domain>+Effect+Testable.swift
-    <Domain>+LoggerExtensions.swift
-```
